# Code_Aster Command File - Generated by MecwayAsterBridge
# Template for vibro-acoustics: coupled eigenmodes of a structure
# and an air or liquid volume (Mecway Frequency model V30 with a
# fluid part). PHENOMENE='MECANIQUE' with 3D_FLUIDE (fluid),
# FLUI_STRU (coupling face) and the ordinary mechanical elements, FORMULATION
# 'U_P_PHI' (test case adlv100a). Filled in via str.format() from
# bridge_vibroacoustic.build_vibroacoustic_modes.
#
# Placeholders (name between single braces):
#   defigroup_block   -> DEFI_GROUP / CREA_MAILLAGE / MODI_MAILLAGE
#                        (structure, as in modal) and ORIE_PEAU of the
#                        coupling faces (normal out of the fluid)
#   model_block       -> AFFE_MODELE: structure, 3D_FLUIDE, FLUI_STRU
#   cara_elem_block   -> AFFE_CARA_ELEM (beams, shells, springs, masses)
#   materials_block   -> DEFI_MATERIAU: ELAS (structure), FLUIDE (RHO,
#                        CELE_R)
#   fieldmat_block    -> AFFE_MATERIAU (coupling faces get the fluid)
#   loads_block       -> supports of the structure and pressure nodes
#                        (DDL_IMPO PRES = 0, PHI = 0)
#   assemblage_block  -> ASSEMBLAGE RIGI_MECA and MASS_MECA
#   calc_modes_block  -> band search (INFO_MODE), CALC_MODES BANDE,
#                        EXTR_MODE -> res
#   export_block      -> aster_results_export (one <mode> per mode with
#                        displ and pressure)
#   impr_resu_block   -> IMPR_RESU MED (only with "med_export")
#
# A brace that is not a placeholder: double it ({{ or }}).

DEBUT(LANG='EN')

# =====================================================
# 1. MESH (FORMAT='ASTER', bridge_mesh.py; UNITE=20 = 'F mail ... D 20')
# =====================================================
mesh = LIRE_MAILLAGE(UNITE=20, FORMAT='ASTER')

mesh = DEFI_GROUP(
    reuse=mesh,
    MAILLAGE=mesh,
    CREA_GROUP_MA=_F(
        NOM='all_elems',
        TOUT='OUI',
    ),
    CREA_GROUP_NO=_F(
        NOM='all_nodes',
        GROUP_MA='all_elems',
    ),
)

{defigroup_block}

# =====================================================
# 2. MODEL, SECTIONS, MATERIALS
# =====================================================
{model_block}

{cara_elem_block}

{materials_block}

{fieldmat_block}

# =====================================================
# 3. BOUNDARY CONDITIONS (supports, pressure nodes)
# =====================================================
{loads_block}

# =====================================================
# 4. MATRICES (ASSEMBLAGE, U4.61.21)
# =====================================================
{assemblage_block}

# =====================================================
# 5. COUPLED EIGENMODES (INFO_MODE, CALC_MODES BANDE)
# =====================================================
{calc_modes_block}

# =====================================================
# 6. RESULTS TO MECWAY
# =====================================================
{export_block}

{impr_resu_block}

FIN()
